From cf6e663e3a1756d5e876384837b027bf859ffb28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (audit)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:16:41 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 09/14] frontend: shared states, lint clean-up, lazy routes,
 bundled KaTeX, tests

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011d4mgSxngjRmAXosGe4ry4

- New components/common/States.jsx (Spinner, LoadingState, EmptyState,
  ErrorState) and hooks/useNow.js; semantic colour tokens (success, warning,
  danger, info, surface) and a card radius in tailwind.config.js.
- Tutor dashboard reports which sections failed to load with a retry, and
  'refreshed' is only claimed when everything loaded. Student portal and the
  tuition workspace no longer turn API failures into empty lists; the
  workspace loads its five requests in parallel.
- Tuition workspace 'Password' button did nothing (its modal was never
  rendered); it opens the reset-password dialog now.
- Exam taker: drafts survive full/blocked storage, auto-submit uses an effect
  event instead of a ref written during render.
- Leaderboard ignores a slow answer for a previously opened exam.
- Exam form: editor created before use, tuition list keeps the chosen group,
  hook dependencies complete.
- Remove dead files (CycleGrid, SubmissionsGradingModal, TutorDetailView,
  App.css), 80+ unused imports/variables, unused deps (clsx, tailwind-merge)
  and the pinned rolldown binding (the lockfile has every platform).
- Role pages are lazy-loaded (entry chunk 378 kB -> 42 kB); fixed vendor
  chunking ('lucide-react' and '@tiptap/react' were lumped into vendor-react).
- KaTeX CSS comes from the installed katex 0.19 (CDN copy was 0.16.9).
- Vitest + jsdom with tests for the API client, MCQ parser/rules and dates.
